{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "初始化缺失",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 130.58,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "普通合约用构造函数设置主人。代理合约不行。",
   "spoken": "普通合约用构造函数设置主人。代理合约不行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.016,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.767
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "构造函数只在实现合约自己的存储里运行，写不进代理。",
   "spoken": "构造函数只在实现合约自己的存储里运行，写不进代理。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.836,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 6.934,
   "speechEnd": 11.362
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "所以可升级合约用一个初始化函数代替，部署以后再调用一次。",
   "spoken": "所以可升级合约用一个初始化函数代替，部署以后再掉用一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.432,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 12.53,
   "speechEnd": 17.934
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "这一次调用，就是风险所在。",
   "spoken": "这一次掉用，就是风险所在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.988,
   "dur": 3.024,
   "speechStart": 19.086,
   "speechEnd": 21.181
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "第一种情况：部署代理和初始化，分成了两笔交易。",
   "spoken": "第一种情况：部署代理和初始化，分成了两笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 22.232,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 22.33,
   "speechEnd": 26.223
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "中间有空隙，别人可以抢先初始化，成为主人。修复是在同一笔交易里完成。",
   "spoken": "中间有空隙，别人可以抢先初始化，成为主人。修复是在同一笔交易里完成。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.276,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 27.374,
   "speechEnd": 33.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第二种：初始化函数可以重复调用，任何人都能重置主人。修复是加上只能调用一次的修饰器。",
   "spoken": "第二种：初始化函数可以虫复掉用，任何人都能虫置主人。修复是加上只能掉用一次的修饰器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 34.816,
   "dur": 8.904,
   "speechStart": 34.914,
   "speechEnd": 42.875
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "第三种：代理初始化了，实现合约本身没有。",
   "spoken": "第三种：代理初始化了，实现合约本身没有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 43.94,
   "dur": 4.512,
   "speechStart": 44.038,
   "speechEnd": 47.609
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "代理的初始化，写在代理的存储里。实现合约自己的存储，还是空的。",
   "spoken": "代理的初始化，写在代理的存储里。实现合约自己的存储，还是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 48.672,
   "dur": 6.648,
   "speechStart": 48.77,
   "speechEnd": 54.493
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "先猜一道题。别人能直接调用实现合约的初始化函数吗？",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。别人能直接掉用实现合约的初始化函数吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 55.54,
   "dur": 5.856,
   "speechStart": 55.638,
   "speechEnd": 60.576
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "能。他会成为实现合约的主人。",
   "spoken": "能。他会成为实现合约的主人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 61.896,
   "dur": 3.816,
   "speechStart": 61.994,
   "speechEnd": 64.86
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "如果实现合约里有 delegatecall 或者自毁的路径，所有指向它的代理，都可能失效。",
   "spoken": "如果实现合约里有 delegatecall 或者自毁的路径，所有指向它的代理，都可能失效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 65.932,
   "dur": 6.768,
   "speechStart": 66.03,
   "speechEnd": 71.863
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "2021 年 9 月，OpenZeppelin 发布安全公告：它的 UUPS 实现，有几个版本存在这个问题，随后发布了修复版本。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 9 月，OpenZeppelin 发布安全公告：它的 UUPS 实现，有几个版本存在这个问题，随后发布了修复版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 72.92,
   "dur": 9.024,
   "speechStart": 73.018,
   "speechEnd": 81.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "修复是在实现合约的构造函数里，禁用初始化。这样谁都不能再初始化它。",
   "spoken": "修复是在实现合约的构造函数里，禁用初始化。这样谁都不能再初始化它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 82.164,
   "dur": 7.128,
   "speechStart": 82.262,
   "speechEnd": 88.462
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "回到开头的 Nomad。它的问题，出在升级时的初始化参数。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的 Nomad。它的问题，出在升级时的初始化参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 89.512,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 89.61,
   "speechEnd": 94.643
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "合约用一张表，记录每个根什么时候被确认。升级把全零这个根，标记成了已确认。",
   "spoken": "合约用一张表，记录每个根什么时候被确认。升级把全零这个根，标记成了已确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 95.708,
   "dur": 7.56,
   "speechStart": 95.806,
   "speechEnd": 102.422
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "而没被证明过的消息，查到的根，默认也是全零。",
   "spoken": "而没被证明过的消息，查到的根，默认也是全零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 103.488,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 103.586,
   "speechEnd": 107.347
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "默认值和合法值，撞在了一起。",
   "spoken": "默认值和合法值，撞在了一起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 108.388,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 108.486,
   "speechEnd": 110.771
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "教训有三条。初始化参数，和代码一样需要审计。",
   "spoken": "教训有三条。初始化参数，和代码一样需要审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 111.824,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 111.922,
   "speechEnd": 116.336
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "零值不能带有业务含义，默认值必须和合法值区分开。",
   "spoken": "零值不能带有业务含义，默认值必须和合法值区分开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
   "start": 117.396,
   "dur": 5.16,
   "speechStart": 117.494,
   "speechEnd": 121.72
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "升级以后要跑回归测试，覆盖这一条：未授权的消息必须被拒绝。",
   "spoken": "升级以后要跑回归测试，覆盖这一条：未授权的消息必须被拒绝。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-20.mp3",
   "start": 122.776,
